name: Exact file context remains bounded within partial repository enumeration
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/partial_evidence_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 60 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: map
require-live-snap: 60 SYSTEM SUMMARY | alpha-map
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 30 Map ✓ | accepted-alpha
keys: Tab z Down
require-live-snap: 30 selected 2/6 · ctx 2 | selected-component
expect: Alpha receiver
expect: g plan context
keys: g
require-live-snap: 30 PLAN EVIDENCE CONTEXT | exact-context-plan
expect: 2 exact evidence files
keys: t
type: 3
keys: Enter r
type: 2
keys: Enter
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 180 Draft ready | partial-inventory-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/partial_evidence_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
require-live-snap: 30 Repository enumeration: partial | inventory-extent
expect: all selected files are recorded
resize: 160x48
wait: 0.5
live-snap: extent-160x48
resize: 96x89
wait: 0.5
live-snap: extent-96x89
resize: 80x24
wait: 0.5
live-snap: extent-80x24
resize: 60x20
wait: 0.5
live-snap: extent-60x20
resize: 40x12
wait: 0.5
live-snap: extent-40x12
expect: 2 files · 1 job · 1 attempt
expect: Calls: 3 max · 2 for Review
expect: Dollar estimate unavailable
expect: openai-oauth:gpt-5.5
expect: M model
expect: s retention
keys: NPage
live-snap: extent-read-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: extent-limits-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: extent-omissions-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: extent-spending-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: extent-final-40x12
ask: Can the operator distinguish known selected membership, partial repository enumeration, source excerpt limits and separate spending approval across all six sizes?
resize: 120x36
wait: 0.5
keys: Enter End
require-live-snap: 30 y approve | approve-one-job
expect: Threat context: inherited
expect: Evidence: 2 exact files
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 Open approved context job | approved
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 L starts the approved jobs | fixed-job
keys: L
require-live-snap: 60 dispatcher pid | launched
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/partial_evidence_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
keys: r
require-live-snap: 60 Jobs: 1 · 1 completed | completed
keys: a
require-live-snap: 30 EVIDENCE CONTEXT DRAFT | result
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 CONTEXT SUMMARY | generated-context
keys: NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 30 Repository enumeration: partial | result-extent
expect: Selected source partial: false
ask: Does the inactive result distinguish complete selected excerpts from partial repository inventory without claiming complete coverage or changing the active context?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 60 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume.txt
keys: Enter
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 30 EVIDENCE CONTEXT DRAFT | recovered-result
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 CONTEXT SUMMARY | recovered-context
keys: NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 30 Repository enumeration: partial | recovered-extent
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/partial_evidence_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART recovered
ask: Does no-color restart retain the same context, exact file membership, inventory limitations and single intercepted request without approving follow-up work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
